  "analytical_usefulness": 0.72,
  "source_groundedness": 0.66,
  "rationale": "The added columns give several real axes (sector, VC flag, geographic cluster) for explaining regional location, with proximity_cluster and industry_sector being the strongest. Groundedness is mixed: geographic and sector categories are largely sound extractions, but the VC flag contradicts a clear VC (Accel), and talent_density_proxy asserts ratings the short source text cannot support. Some redundancy (is_life_science/is_venture_capital vs industry_sector) and one near-constant column (founding_stage_focus) modestly reduce leverage but do not fail the necessary conditions."
